---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Contact HowNote"
  description="Contact HowNote about engineering tools, standards references, corrections or sourcing workflows."
>
  <section class="hero container legal-hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Contact</div>
    <h1>Questions, corrections and project inquiries.</h1>
    <p>HowNote is being built in public stages. Clear source corrections and practical workflow feedback are especially useful.</p>
  </section>

  <article class="container prose">
    <h2>Email</h2>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="mailto:hello@hownote.net">hello@hownote.net</a></p>
    <p class="muted">The project email route must be activated before public outreach begins. Until then, delivery may not be available.</p>

    <h2>Helpful details to include</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The exact HowNote page or URL.</li>
      <li>The standard number and edition/year involved.</li>
      <li>The product, size, material or calculation input.</li>
      <li>A primary or manufacturer source that supports the correction.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Do not send confidential purchasing documents yet</h2>
    <p>HowNote does not currently provide an authenticated upload area. Do not email confidential drawings, contracts, MTC/MTR files or supplier pricing unless a secure channel has been agreed separately.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
